{
 "file": "story/spt/f07_010_161_10_t081.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1034,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1045,
   "src": "200d37c1edba",
   "t": "The height of simplicity."
  },
  {
   "i": 1063,
   "src": "7532df24ea74",
   "t": "Uuugh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1068,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1074,
   "src": "669e8ef39214",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 1085,
   "src": "a36f2db043bd",
   "t": "Okay, a {{robattle}} it is."
  },
  {
   "i": 1096,
   "src": "566751f950f3",
   "t": "All things considered, to draw in\nstudents"
  },
  {
   "i": 1099,
   "src": "160030a9e031",
   "t": "in, I think it has the most appeal."
  },
  {
   "i": 1114,
   "src": "f6228b83d71a",
   "t": "Best of all, it looks easy to prepare,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1117,
   "src": "120651139310",
   "t": "which is wonderful."
  },
  {
   "i": 1124,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "333064b655ba",
   "t": "There's easy, and then there's too easy."
  },
  {
   "i": 1133,
   "src": "77b42238319a",
   "t": "A plain {{robattle}}? What'd the President\nsay..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1146,
   "src": "6447006caffb",
   "t": "Hmm."
  },
  {
   "i": 1149,
   "src": "fa8f91958b56",
   "t": "All right, how about this."
  },
  {
   "i": 1157,
   "src": "3e0e8b273fe2",
   "t": "The junkyard has plenty of {{robattle}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1160,
   "src": "18589800925e",
   "t": "practice targets, so we can use those--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1168,
   "src": "686b1fafdc07",
   "t": "We'll make it a game of how many\ntargets"
  },
  {
   "i": 1171,
   "src": "2694c85c0f7e",
   "t": "you can take down, like a shooting\ngallery."
  },
  {
   "i": 1179,
   "src": "ba62358296f6",
   "t": "We'll be the opponents. Like at a fair:"
  },
  {
   "i": 1182,
   "src": "f6e7bf268a07",
   "t": "{{destroy}} more targets than us and you\nwin."
  },
  {
   "i": 1190,
   "src": "3879bb1e45e4",
   "t": "Winners get the password... and that's\nit."
  },
  {
   "i": 1193,
   "src": "af79158af92c",
   "t": "Yeah, this works. It's settled."
  },
  {
   "i": 1200,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1209,
   "src": "6a6b75035164",
   "t": "Fine, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1217,
   "src": "a8ae27bca0e1",
   "t": "We have to give everyone the password,\nright?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1220,
   "src": "2d4452ce60ca",
   "t": "So we lose on purpose to everybody?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1230,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1239,
   "src": "b368003fd97a",
   "t": "Yep. It gets easier"
  },
  {
   "i": 1242,
   "src": "572162444a60",
   "t": "and easier, which is great."
  },
  {
   "i": 1252,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1258,
   "src": "67a4fea580eb",
   "t": "No, that'd be a problem as a show."
  },
  {
   "i": 1261,
   "src": "42a20aefa4fc",
   "t": "We did win the tournament, after all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1271,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1277,
   "src": "392896f17e54",
   "t": "Hmm... Okay,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1280,
   "src": "09566ff30b12",
   "t": "casual but serious, then."
  },
  {
   "i": 1288,
   "src": "984cd2b45c0f",
   "t": "That's actually harder."
  },
  {
   "i": 1293,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1299,
   "src": "da55956f9710",
   "t": "Well, let's go all out at first."
  },
  {
   "i": 1302,
   "src": "7f8cca574cf4",
   "t": "Then switch to host mode at the right\ntime."
  },
  {
   "i": 1309,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1315,
   "src": "6e4764cb7fd9",
   "t": "Got it."
  },
  {
   "i": 1322,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1328,
   "src": "c4f81ba9229f",
   "t": "Phew, finally done. It seemed easy,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1331,
   "src": "bcdef5539d9f",
   "t": "but I'm glad we settled it."
  },
  {
   "i": 1338,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1347,
   "src": "00a4ea100c64",
   "t": "...Hey."
  },
  {
   "i": 1354,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1363,
   "src": "91908cc727dc",
   "t": "What's up?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1370,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1379,
   "src": "6025d269ffad",
   "t": "If we have spare time, shall we do"
  },
  {
   "i": 1382,
   "src": "1a6eec0201ec",
   "t": "the remaining {{medalia}} search quests?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1389,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1398,
   "src": "c0cf70cf166c",
   "t": "Oh,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1401,
   "src": "3bac6ba8e65c",
   "t": "you're pretty motivated."
  },
  {
   "i": 1408,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1417,
   "src": "cfed66c87f86",
   "t": "Not really. I just don't want someone\nelse"
  },
  {
   "i": 1420,
   "src": "8c2b27a48ae2",
   "t": "to grab them first, that's all."
  }
 ]
}
